OL,3,GNEWSAAlcohol licence approved for
OL,4,A'workers' hub' hotel
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn alcohol licence has been granted for
OL,7,Fa hotel described as a "workers' hub"
OL,8,Ffor a nearby freeport and industrial
OL,9,Farea.
OL,11,FThe Commercial on Middlesbrough Road,
OL,12,FSouth Bank, is expected to mainly serve
OL,13,Fpeople working at Teesworks when it
OL,14,Fopens and employ 13 people in a first
OL,15,Fwave of jobs.
OL,17,FAddressing two crime-related
OL,18,Fobjections, applicant Chris Hankinson
OL,19,Ftold Redcar and Cleveland Council the
OL,20,F42-room hotel's bar and restaurant was
OL,21,Fa "necessary evil" for guests.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,393,390,260,160,0,100
