OL,3,GNEWSAAlcohol licence approved for
OL,4,A'workers' hub' hotel
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe authority's regulatory committee
OL,7,Fgranted the licence for alcohol sales
OL,8,Fand music from 11:00 to 23:00 at a
OL,9,Fmeeting on Tuesday after three minutes
OL,10,Fof deliberation.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
